WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
For decades, the exact science of waifus has been a mystery,

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.500
as our collective understanding of these entities and the ways humans react to them

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.220
continue to baffle scientists to the modern day.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.800
So today, I would like to present my findings to you - the board -

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.100
in hopes that one day this research can be expanded on and completed.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.800
[Music]

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:24.300
As far as we can tell, Waifus are horrific Lovecraftian beings of unknown origin

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.340
with the power to destroy entire species by inhibiting their desire to breed.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.200
While we have been able to prevent this so far with the human race,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.220
as time has gone on, their attacks have only become more effective,

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.600
and we get closer to the possibility of mass extinction every day.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:44.380
The widely accepted root of the word 'waifu' stems from the butchered Japanese pronunciation of the English word "wife",

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.460
which has become the adopted explanation by popular culture.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:53.280
But recent studies have suggested that the word actually comes from an abbreviation to the question, "WAIFU?"

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.500
"Why am I forever unloved?" - as the entities themselves serve as an answer to that question.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:05.360
The exact appeal of waifus stem from their power to invoke a dormant gene present in all humans known as the Protecc Gene.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:11.560
Once invoked, the Protecc Gene raises strong primal instincts in an individual, granting a sense of temporary euphoria,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.640
bypassing the developed logical brain, which would usually rationalize to an individual

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:21.500
that spending over $100 for a JPEG printout on a bag of feathers might actually be a bad idea.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.660
Even though the effects of the Protecc Gene is normally seen in humans,

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:30.080
it should be noted that animals also possess it, with the most recent case of its effects being seen in penguins,

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.400
proving that even animals are not immune to shit taste.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:37.820
While there is high variance among individuals as to which waifu is most appealing to them,

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.960
a peculiar event occurs when enough anime fans gather together, as a sort of hive mind begins to form,

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:49.700
abandoning all sense of individuality in order to collectively determine the most superior waifu in any given set.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.120
This event is known as the Best Girl Ultimatum,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:57.400
an event that causes enough sodium chloride to form to poison the surrounding area.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:01.060
Newcomers can often be confused as to what exactly constitutes a Best Girl,

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.800
but once an individual spends enough time in the community,

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.760
they may be able to develop an additional sense; a kind of sixth sense

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:13.220
in which, on initial viewing of a new show, they can immediately detect who will be Best Girl.

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:17.960
This phenomenon is known as the Compounded Anime Neural Character Exposure Response,

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.900
though it's more commonly referred to by its shortened form:

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:21.600
CANCER.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:26.600
While there is yet to be any proven hypothesis around what makes a Best Girl in any given situation,

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.400
I would like to propose the following theory that can break down

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:33.360
the overall effectiveness of any given waifu in a Best Girl race.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:39.460
Let's start with Personality - this can be broken down into two parts: the Depth Determiner, and Disposability.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:44.360
The Depth Determiner refers to the credibility of a certain waifu, and this is a slippery slope.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:47.980
Waifus are meant to represent a certain ideology within a life-partner,

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:51.120
and in this sense, they can almost be seen as something similar to deities.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.720
In fact, some waifus themselves are deities.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:58.500
Because hey, if an all-seeing all-knowing omnipotent being exists that could take any form,

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.320
why couldn't it be...

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.040
...a Tsundere high school girl in short skirts?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:07.980
Or as some experts in Waifuology have suggested, why shouldn't it be...

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.940
*quieter* a Tsundere high school girl in short skirts?

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:14.300
However, it is important that they remain believable but not too believable.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:18.060
Too perfect, and the entity may come off as one-dimensional, boring, and flat.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.760
But too believable and they might become too hu-

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.320
*loud choking noise*

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.680
H-*chokes trying to speak*

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.720
HU-*chokes trying to speak once more*

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.500
- human.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.800
Which brings us to our second criteria: disposability.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.320
There is an abundance of choice when it comes to waifu types,

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:33.560
but while different personality types cater to different individuals,

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.060
a large subset may be filed as a Disposable Waifu,

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.740
in which a waifu may just feel like a reskinned version of another character.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:47.820
This is not to be confused with Trash Waifus, as that refers to waifus picked up by individuals who have forsaken their humanity;

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.260
at least a bit more so than the usual anime fan.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:55.900
The important thing is that if a waifu can be easily swapped out to any similar character from elsewhere

00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:00.020
without much overall impact in-universe, it increases their disposability.

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:03.980
For example, if you replace Umaru with a piece of turd wearing an orange hoodie,

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:07.620
it would not actually make much of a difference to the in-universe narrative.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.020
My apologies, I would like to make an amendment to that last statement.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.620
It would actually make a massive difference.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.200
The piece of turd wouldn't be loud and annoying.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:23.520
Physical characteristics are also a very important part of any waifu, as any unique features may give them an advantage to others without them.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.600
This includes, but is not limited to:

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:32.600
fangs, glasses, thigh-highs, elf ears, ponytails, twin tails, real tails, big boobs, small boobs, no boobs,

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.960
and of course, most powerful of all,

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:35.920
a penis.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.260
Sex appeal is also an important factor that is split into two sections.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:45.280
On one side, you have waifus with high sex appeal that people very much appreciate and find totally acceptable to lewd.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:49.400
And on the other side, you have the innocent kinds that have no sex appeal whatsoever that people just

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:54.380
want to protect and everyone agrees that under no circumstances are they acceptable to lewd.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.300
But people lewd them anyway.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:05:00.420
A waifu can increase their best girl chances by appealing to a certain fetish,

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:05.700
but the real power comes when they allow an individual to discover a fetish they never knew they had.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:10.480
However, sex appeal should never come at the cost of going against the ideology of being an ideal

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:16.540
dedicated life partner, as this merely increases their Thot Factor, which is a death sentence for any waifu.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:21.840
Then we get to arguably the most important factor for waifu's Best Girl candidacy:

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.520
The Kawaii Coefficient.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:28.300
This refers to unique attributes a waifu possesses which can be seen as 'cute'.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:34.500
With a high-enough Kawaii Coefficient, even seemingly one-dimensional waifus can have a higher standing than they arguably should.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.740
A common way to achieve this is by giving them a weird quirk.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:42.860
Maybe they really like explosions, or licking people, or smelling people, or they're...

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.100
...mentally disabled, or they're a

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.960
psychotic nut-job mass murderer,

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:51.140
or they’re a mentally disabled psychotic nut-job mass murderer who's also

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:51.800
a Loli.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:58.100
Whatever it is, it should be noticed that pretty much any quirk can be turned into something cute within the Laws of Waifu,

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:01.800
even if it makes absolutely no sense in the real world.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.180
If she’s overly aggressive and borderline abusive,

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.260
we call that “being Tsundere”.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:10.360
If she’s a wise wolf god wandering the world in human form, we call that

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.900
“Fuck you Dave, this is not Bestiality”.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:19.180
And if she’s a 500-year old immortal vampire who also happens to be trapped in a Loli body, we call that

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.860
"I swear Officer, she’s totally legal”.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.080
The rules of the real world do not apply to waifus.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:29.660
In fact, through the power of anthropomorphism, anything can be a waifu.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.660
Anything.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.920
Cats. Ships. Horses.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:36.520
Anything is fair game, so it's only really a matter of time before we see...

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.600
...anthropomorphized vacuum cleaners. *starts laughing*

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:41.740
Wait. Are you – ?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.060
– are you fuckin' – ??

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.060
*in the distance* Are you FUCKING KIDDING ME?!?

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:50.520
Of course, this brings us to the most complex mechanic to understand, which is known as the Waifu Meta.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:55.620
The cutthroat game of Best Girl is a constantly changing landscape, with new additions continually being added

00:06:55.620 --> 00:07:00.740
which affect the overall ecosystem, changing the effectiveness of everything we previously talked about.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:04.820
An understanding of this landscape rapidly improves a waifu's standing in the current meta,

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.300
and can increase or decrease their viability for best girl in any given situation.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:15.780
For instance, someone like Emilia was quite strong on release, having pretty solid base stats in every category that made her a popular pick.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.900
But pretty soon after, she just got completely hard-countered by Rem,

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:22.700
giving her a loss by default where she hasn't been able to recover ever since.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.740
Something similar happened recently between Zero Two and Ichigo from DARLING in the FRANXX,

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:31.220
but that was more the result of a high tier waifu being called out for a 1v1 by someone who is

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.320
clearly still trying to climb out of bronze.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.800
The effects of the Waifu Meta are so severe that there have been time periods where

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.800
nonsensical pics such as Dio Brando and Kaiki have been viable for Best Girl,

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:43.680
even if science has never even classified them as waifus.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:47.560
It is also able to counteract the importance of previously discussed factors.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:52.260
Disposability is less of a factor if a waifu is the first to popularize a certain trend,

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:56.800
but a single imbalanced waifu is also able to start the revival of an old meta,

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:03.080
as we just saw last year with Sagiri bringing the resurgence of the Imouto Meta we hadn’t seen since 2013,

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.800
which absolutely nobody wanted but we ended up appreciating anyway.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:11.020
Even someone as old as Asuka can remain relevant thanks to her constant reworks.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.800
If this is confusing for you, then I recommend sticking to the comfort pics

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.960
that have stood the test of time and have remained viable in almost every meta.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:24.100
For example, someone like Rin will always remain a strong pick, as she's in the Tsundere class, which will pretty much always be viable.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.600
But this gives her very high synergy with her Twin Tail and Thigh-High builds,

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:31.100
plus having one of the best Blush skills in anime when fully maxed.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:34.080
The only thing she has going against her is when Saber is counter-picked,

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.900
and even then it comes down to an even skill match-up.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:42.100
In conclusion, the science behind waifus and their ability to become Best Girl is a complicated field,

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:46.520
and science is still a ways away from being able to find the ultimate Best Girl.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.820
While we can rationalize a lot of the power through

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:52.980
Depth Determiner, Disposability, Thot Factor, and the Kawaii Coefficient

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.660
through the power of the Waifu Meta and pretty much anything being able to be turned into a waifu

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.540
- whether it be through anthropomorphization or just putting a blush effect on something -

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.000
further research is required.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:09.380
But from what we have discussed today, I can conclude only one thing for certain:

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.240
Give an anime fan any object,

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.900
and they will find a way to want to stick their dick in it.

